NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000967 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000968 "=item * can_valign"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000969 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000970 "Provide a way for user to specify vertical alignment (topE<sol>middleE<sol>bottom) of cells."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000971 ""
